   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coop soc sec Murmansk</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samv social sektor Murman</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet skall &#xE5;g&#xE5; i tv&#xE5; &#xE5;r och syftar till kunskaps&#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring inom social sektor i Murmansk l&#xE4;n vad g&#xE4;ller familjeplanering, handikappade barn samt kvinnors alkohol- och drogmissbruk.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at a transfer of knowledge in the social sector and is a cooperation between the municipality of Lule&#xE5; and Murmansk Regional Administration. The project is planned to be carried out over two years and the aim is to transfer knowledge in the field of family planning, handicapped children and drug abuse among women.</narrative>
  </description>
